1
00:00:19,431 --> 00:00:21,477
Rhinedottir... something's wrong...

2
00:00:31,108 --> 00:00:34,379
We're not done. You're not going anywhere

3
00:01:10,455 --> 00:01:11,286
Pierro...!

4
00:01:14,501 --> 00:01:15,314
Just in time...

5
00:01:17,023 --> 00:01:19,775
Though it's never been tested in live combat...

6
00:01:20,326 --> 00:01:24,155
At least the "Eye of the Fatui" was completed in time

7
00:01:25,418 --> 00:01:28,357
You should not be able to wield that power...

8
00:01:29,245 --> 00:01:32,311
No mortal body or mind can withstand it

9
00:01:33,064 --> 00:01:35,714
Even with my Curse of Immortality...

10
00:01:38,315 --> 00:01:40,546
The Fatui do not care

11
00:01:41,148 --> 00:01:43,504
For the right to gaze upon the gods

12
00:01:43,504 --> 00:01:49,524
Whatever the price may be, whatever I must suffer, so be it!

13
00:01:55,714 --> 00:01:57,515
Nice job, Eftirvit

14
00:02:26,430 --> 00:02:27,625
That is enough!

15
00:02:30,894 --> 00:02:32,539
Watch out, here it comes again...

16
00:02:42,396 --> 00:02:45,063
Not again... I thought we'd have more time...

17
00:02:50,083 --> 00:02:53,955
Come on... I have to get back... before it's too late!

18
00:02:59,492 --> 00:03:01,119
Faster... Faster!

19
00:03:20,895 --> 00:03:21,345
You...!

20
00:03:45,075 --> 00:03:46,961
It all makes sense now...

21
00:03:47,673 --> 00:03:49,992
The six Gnoses you collected...

22
00:03:50,672 --> 00:03:52,526
It was all to deal with me

23
00:04:02,419 --> 00:04:03,908
I'm surprised

24
00:04:04,798 --> 00:04:08,392
With Cryo energy maximally enhanced by the Gnoses

25
00:04:09,127 --> 00:04:11,243
You can affect the bounds of Reason...

26
00:04:12,314 --> 00:04:15,237
Not enough to completely freeze space and time

27
00:04:16,129 --> 00:04:19,873
But enough to slow down the flow of time where we are...

28
00:04:20,642 --> 00:04:23,922
Am I wrong, Cryo Archon?

